        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mazeppa%2C_Minnesota"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Mazeppa’s last train departed in 1952, ending over a century of rail service.",
